Amenonuboco (ot-range-amenonuboco)
Copyright 2026 Daichi Terayama

This product includes software developed as part of the Amenonuboco
project (Cyber Range as Code), a manifest-driven dynamic provisioning
platform for OT/ICS cyber ranges.

Predecessor project: ot-ids-verum (https://github.com/schutzz/ot-ids-verum),
whose reference implementations and design lessons (documented in this
project's `blog_project/plans/amenonuboco/pitfalls-log.md` and decision
logs) informed the design of this platform.
